  "details": "enable collisions with walls and other avatars like in BONELAB\n\nas it is now\n\nwhen your head goes thru a wall the immersion breaks\n\nwhen your hands go thru the hands of another player the immersion breaks\n\nwhen your body goes thru another player the immersion breaks\n\nif you are a puzzle map creator your players are probably glitching their heads thru the walls to cheat\n\nafter this gets accepted\n\nyou can touch avatars\n\nyou can hit the walls\n\nyou won't be able to cheat puzzle maps or spy on other players from behind the walls\n\nexample:\n\nyou're playing with your friend at the pool\n\nyour friend goes to the jumping board but doesn't jump\n\nyou go behind her a push her into the water\n\nin vrchat you would go thru her body\n\nin real life you would push her\n\nNOTE\n\nthis is something that will not be calculated by the server, it will be calculated by the client so there won't be any delay and it will be as heavy as running a racing game on a playstation one",
